WEBVTT

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.270
All hail! God save the king!

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:24.310
Bless King Edward IV!
Bless the Royal Family of York!

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.230
We've repurchased the throne
with our enemies' blood.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:33.490
Where is Richard, the star
performer in our victory?

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:36.240
Well, Richard said that he would go...

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.200
...to the Tower.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.420
A thousand soldiers' blood
may pay for a throne,

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:50.840
but only a king's blood
can pay for my father's soul.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:55.470
I'm simply going to speak
with the former king.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:59.800
But Your Grace, I can't admit you
without the king's permission.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:03.140
And, well, Henry's longstanding
illness has worsened.

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:06.520
He can't converse.
He doesn't even know who he is.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:11.360
You mean he's forgotten
that he was ever king?!

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.700
York of the white rose.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:20.280
Lancaster of the red rose.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:26.790
These royal houses with roses for
their crests battled for the throne.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:31.540
People call their strife
the "Wars of the Roses."

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:09.560
A blessing! A blessing on this cursed day!

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:12.350
You look nothing like your brothers!

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:13.860
You're a demon child!

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:16.900
All hail! Bless the demon child!

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:19.650
The season of malediction will come again!

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:25.870
Beautiful. That was a splendid dance.

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:29.450
But it's no match for
the beauty of my queen.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:30.330
Your Majesty.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:32.250
Oh, what a surprise!

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:35.590
Here's the most beautiful person
in the whole world!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.920
My noble mother!

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:39.300
Edward!

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:45.390
You look just like your
father would as king.

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:46.470
George!

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:47.720
Mother!

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.560
George!

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:55.610
Your father's soul
has reunited our family,

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:59.400
and our bonds will now endure forever.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:02.820
Richard, embrace our mother as well.

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:05.030
Save that for another time.

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:09.620
Your Majesty, everyone is waiting
for the banquet to resume.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.330
That's true.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:17.210
Then henceforth let us indulge ourselves
in entertainment and spectacle!

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:19.300
The war is over!

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:27.640
My light will never return.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:34.390
Even if I kill, and kill, and kill.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:44.950
Here's your meal.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:48.280
He doesn't even stir.
Are we sure he's not dead?

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.410
I'll take it from here.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:53.250
You go join in the party.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.410
But...

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.130
Let's take him up on his kind offer.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.790
Our humble thanks, Your Grace.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:30.620
I've come to kill you.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:34.080
Do you recognize me?

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.170
I don't.

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:43.000
I don't know why

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.590
you left me.

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:51.260
The wolves are watching me.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:55.140
The wolves want to gobble me up.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:57.100
I'm scared!

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:59.230
Help, Mother!

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:04.980
Henry.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.370
Henry.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:21.710
Look at me!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:25.510
Look at the face of the man
who's going to kill you!

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:32.760
Are you going to run away like that?

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:36.430
Look, Henry!

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.490
Don't leave me alone.

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:06.630
I despise you.

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:10.510
I hate you more than I can bear.

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:23.610
Richard...

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.320
Henry!

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:35.910
Impossible. Even as a joke,
that's in poor taste.

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:38.700
Could you have been
drunk and seeing things?

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:43.330
Edward, you don't know
what Richard really is.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.420
That child is a demon!

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:47.960
He seduces people to their destruction!

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:51.880
"Seduces"? It's not as though
he slept with Henry.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.010
Oh, how horrible!

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:57.510
O Lord, protect our family!

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:01.020
Your mother's fears are quite reasonable.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:05.610
Your Majesty's throne still rests
on unsteady foundations.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:09.360
It will do so as long as Henry exists.

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:11.400
But have no fear.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:17.490
I know the best way to assuage
both your and your mother's doubts.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.170
Excuse me, Your Majesty.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:30.340
Fine cloth, is it not? Perfect to make
matching cloaks for my queen and I.

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:31.630
Would you like one?

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:33.510
No, not me.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:35.890
Dress with more flare.

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:40.470
Elegance, not bravery, will be
the mark of power from now on.

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.520
Your Majesty, why did you summon me?

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:45.400
Before you exchange your armor for silks,

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:49.860
there is one piece of business
left to attend to.

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:53.280
An ember of the Lancastrian
inferno that scorched England.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:56.660
The last spark that threatens
the peace of York.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.410
Richard...

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.040
Kill Henry.

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:09.750
If anyone learns that I murdered a former
king who had no intention to rebel,

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:12.840
the people will assuredly censure us.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.920
It must be done in secret.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:19.220
You are the only person
I can trust to do this for me.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:22.720
Is that clear, Richard? I won't wait long.

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:26.560
Show your loyalty to me.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:33.530
I wish it would never stop.

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:37.200
Then, I could stay with you forever.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:40.580
"You"?

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:44.080
Who do I mean?

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.210
You seem so sad.

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:50.960
I know your name.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:54.710
Richard.

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:00.510
Richard.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:01.600
Why?

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:04.810
It hurts.

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:09.650
Once more, just once more, let us kiss.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:14.440
Who are you?

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:19.160
Henry, let me tell you of a demon child.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:24.700
Of a demon child born cursing
the world and cursed by it in turn.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:27.120
Of Richard.

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:46.770
Richard, you are a curse.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:48.940
You are sin itself.

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:52.810
I must atone for your sins!

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.580
Give me the key.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:13.000
Command me.

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:18.800
Please command me to kill Henry.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.800
I've prepared a corpse that resembles him.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:30.640
I said, give me the key.

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:38.610
Once I kill him, it will end.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:41.650
It won't end unless I kill him.

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:48.160
The prophet said

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:53.330
the wolf will come,
and the innocent lamb will offer up

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:55.840
its throat to the demon's fangs.

00:11:56.840 --> 00:12:00.220
The shepherd has gone away.

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:07.220
Even if you don't remember anything,

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:10.850
I remember every last detail.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:14.230
That day, when I first met you,

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:18.110
I escaped the darkness,
and there you were.

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:20.780
You always appeared without warning

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:25.200
to heal my wounds and to tear them open.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:30.370
I had no guarantee of seeing you,
but my longing for you still tormented me.

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:35.170
I hated you more than I could bear.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:37.420
And yet,

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:40.010
I considered giving up everything

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:44.180
if it meant I could live with you.

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:49.350
I had a dream.

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:51.390
A foolish dream.

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:55.730
But there's nothing left of it now.

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:04.950
All that remains...

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.200
...is my sin.

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:14.250
You're...

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:19.590
I was born burdened
with the sin of my body.

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:23.670
I'm not a man.

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:26.300
I'm neither a man nor a woman.

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:29.640
I was born with two sexes.

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:32.930
You're the only one I'll tell the truth.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:36.980
At the end, I'll show you my true form.

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.810
The real me.

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.400
Please, God.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:47.410
Please.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:53.620
Henry,

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:56.540
please love me.

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:14.560
Henry.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:19.440
Let's sin

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:21.980
and go to hell together.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.450
Now, confess.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:35.290
I dreamed many times.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:36.660
Those eyes,

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:37.790
hair,

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:39.080
lips,

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:40.170
warmth.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:46.340
I've never felt like this before.
Not for anyone.

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:50.640
His presence was my salvation.

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:54.760
He's my dear friend,
but before I knew it...

00:14:56.890 --> 00:15:02.810
I found him... found him beautiful.

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:06.780
That feeling took hold of me
and made me suffer.

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:08.650
I couldn't help it!

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:11.030
I want to touch him!

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:14.490
To take everything from him!

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:16.410
What treachery.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:19.750
What blasphemy. What a terrible sin!

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:22.960
Your body is brimming with dreadful lust!

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:25.460
Your wanton mother's impure blood!

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.840
With her blood, you defiled God!

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:32.510
Henry, the Lord God will forgive you.

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:36.260
A demon instigated
every sin in this world.

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:42.400
That demon led you astray
with its demonic flesh.

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:47.650
Wanton nightmares. Suffering.

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:48.990
Hatred.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:50.400
Impulses.

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:52.110
Lust.

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:54.030
Good boy, Henry.

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:56.870
Stop!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.120
Henry.

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:04.380
Stay back.

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:07.300
Don't come near me, demon!

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:10.340
Henry.

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:18.310
The prophet said the day you were born,
a terrible storm laid trees low.

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:22.890
Owls screeched.
Crows croaked in the night.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:23.770
Stop.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:27.770
To herald the coming
of an age of misfortune!

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:29.440
Richard!

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:33.530
Your mother suffered
abnormal birthing pains!

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:36.780
And after all that, her child

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:41.250
looked nothing like its parents
and defied the will of God!

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:43.080
It was a blood-soaked demon!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:50.130
One day, a host of people
who have lost children...

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:51.510
Silence.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:54.470
...will lament the untimely
deaths you have caused.

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:55.340
Silence.

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:56.890
"Why was he ever born?" they will cry--

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:59.810
Silence! Silence! Silence! Silence!

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:12.240
As they curse the day...

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:17.620
...of your birth.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.210
Oh!

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:34.090
Hung be the heavens with black!
Yield day to night!

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:40.600
King Henry VI! England never lost
a king of so much worth!

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:43.560
Comets, importing change
of times and states,

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:45.980
scourge the bad revolting stars

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:49.940
that have consented
to our kind king's death!

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:53.860
My most beloved brother.

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:58.870
And your lovely wife, Isabelle.
Has your sister been well since then?

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:03.240
Your Majesty is too kind.
Words cannot express my gratitude.

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:09.540
My lady sister, however,
is still unwell due to her distress.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.210
Please have no fear.

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:15.920
We'll tend to Anne and the Neville
estate with the utmost care.

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:21.850
How reassuring. Many desire
the Earl of Warwick's vast wealth.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:26.350
See to it that no rogue
leads your sister astray.

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:30.690
Yes, Your Majesty. I will be most careful.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:35.070
Especially of upstart minor nobles.

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:38.860
I won't let that woman's
relatives control the royal family.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:45.250
Your inheritance and Anne's combined
make my power a match for the king's.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:49.330
That's why we need to keep Anne with us.

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:53.040
Murdered? Don't talk nonsense.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:54.590
Everyone's saying it.

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:57.550
They say Richard killed King Henry.

00:18:57.550 --> 00:18:59.800
I saw him on the battlefield.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:05.060
Richard mercilessly struck down
the Earl of Warwick as he fled!

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:07.600
Well, I wouldn't put it past Richard.

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:16.440
--Isabe--
--No, not "Isabelle."

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:19.530
Call me "Your Grace," Anne.

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:24.080
Oh, excuse me.
Anne is my elder sister's name.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:27.790
You're merely a stable hand.

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:31.080
Yes, Your Grace.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:35.050
I'm terribly sorry.
I've been feeling a little unwell lately.

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:38.840
Men seeking your inheritance
visit every day.

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:42.720
I can't possibly let them meet you.

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:46.930
You understand, don't you?
I want to keep my family safe.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:54.360
I was the only one
pardoned after that battle.

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:57.780
Even though I failed to protect anything.

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:01.490
So, at least...

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:03.410
How tragic.

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:06.410
She'll never heal if
she remains unmarried.

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.200
Anne Neville, you mean?

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:10.790
We should help her marry soon.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:14.960
The thought of her plight worries me.

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:19.510
Especially the thought of allowing
George to hold such vast wealth.

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:25.470
I at least want to offer him
one last red rose for Lancaster.

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.480
Please wait!

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:31.480
Please!

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:35.400
Please allow me to mourn
King Henry's passing!

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.980
Lower the casket.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:44.200
Pardon me, Lady Anne Neville.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:48.240
Richard.

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:50.120
How could you...?

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.620
King Henry!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.460
Does this look like Henry to you?

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:59.670
We can hardly exhibit a body
covered in sword wounds.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:05.800
You really did kill him?

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:07.260
I did.

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.510
--And my father!
--I killed him.

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:11.640
Your husband too.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:16.190
As Edward lay bound and sobbing,
I took my sword to his neck and--

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:17.520
Stop!

00:21:20.230 --> 00:21:22.990
What? I've been feeling
strange for some time.

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:24.110
Don't tell me...

00:21:24.570 --> 00:21:27.740
Do you think your family will protect you?

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:30.870
They only want to guard your fortune.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:34.040
Sooner or later,
you'll become an obstacle.

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:37.460
Everyone is waiting
eagerly for your death.

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:39.340
D-Demon.

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:46.550
The Duke Richard I knew is dead.

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:50.810
A demon took his noble soul.

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:54.980
But Lady Anne, let me confess:

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:58.690
I became that way for love.

00:21:58.690 --> 00:22:01.860
Love for you drove me.

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:12.370
Richard, I've thought of
the reward you'll enjoy most.

00:22:12.370 --> 00:22:15.290
Marriage to Anne Neville.

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:18.580
You were my light.

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:23.090
In dream and reality, I sought for you.

00:22:23.090 --> 00:22:26.880
If it would win me a
moment in your embrace,

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:32.010
I would even have slaughtered
every person in the world.

00:22:32.010 --> 00:22:35.980
This is also for the Royal Family
of York. I trust you understand,

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:37.940
Richard?

00:22:37.940 --> 00:22:41.310
If I cannot convince you,
please take this sword...

00:22:42.650 --> 00:22:44.780
...and bury it in my breast.

00:22:47.700 --> 00:22:48.910
Liar.

00:22:48.910 --> 00:22:51.030
I'm not lying.

00:22:51.030 --> 00:22:52.740
Tell me the truth.

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:57.660
Anne, I want you to marry me.

00:22:58.830 --> 00:23:03.130
I'm certain he's not sincere.

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:06.420
After all, he... he...

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:11.550
Richard is dead--

00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:19.480
died alone in the woods that day.
